---
// Inverted call-to-action block (white background, black text). Reused on Home and About.
---
<section class="cta">
  <div class="wrap cta__in" data-reveal>
    <p class="label cta__label">Let's go further together</p>
    <h2>Looking for<br />your next game?</h2>
    <p class="cta__text">If you are a publisher looking for new games or a dedicated mobile game team in Vietnam, we would like to hear from you.</p>
    <a href="/partners#submit" class="btn btn--dark">Get in touch</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta { background: var(--fg); color: var(--bg); padding: clamp(80px, 12vw, 160px) 0; }
  .cta__label { color: #555; }
  .cta h2 { margin-top: 20px; font-size: clamp(36px, 7vw, 80px); max-width: 20ch; }
  .cta__text { margin: 28px 0 40px; max-width: 600px; font-size: clamp(17px, 1.6vw, 20px); color: #333; }
</style>
